{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\"> <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">人工智能營銷服務提供商北京深演智能科技股份有限公司（2723.HK）周一表示，公司與互聯網搜索巨頭百度旗下部門達成戰略合作，共同開發智能服務。  </p> <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">根據協議，深演智能與北京百度網訊科技有限公司將共同開發智能銷量預測、智能供應鏈、智能優化，以及用戶洞察與產品匹配等相關服務。雙方還將攜手打造一體化AI決策解決方案。  </p> <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">深演智能表示，此次合作以其DeepAgent平台為核心。  </p> <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">公告發布後，周二深演智能股價早盤下跌15.8%，午盤休市報收於43.38港元。該股在5月掛牌上市初期曾暴漲兩倍，但此後一路走低，目前較55.5港元的上市價已下跌22%。  </p> <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">陽歌  </p> <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">欲訂閱咏竹坊每周免費通訊，請點擊這裏  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:24.799027+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:21:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:39:20.011662+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:39:18.772727+00:00","content_hash":"e9d262236a6d1f99dd4b03552647bde7bf4264af8ace508c70733e019ef5606e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}